0..43 Comment "//! This source shows manifest model types."
44..47 Comment "//!"
48..121 Comment "//! A manifest model type fixes one sort in a theory model. The type is a"
122..201 Comment "//! family in the fixed sort. So equivalent sort types give equivalent manifest"
202..282 Comment "//! model types. This is the structure identity principle at a fixed sort, after"
283..344 Comment "//! § 2.14 of the HoTT book and the manifest types of Leroy."
345..348 Comment "//!"
349..419 Comment "//! The checker applies each fixed sort to the other model components."
420..482 Comment "//! Transport moves the model fields along an equivalent sort."
483..486 Comment "//!"
487..503 Comment "//! - see: #1480"
504..520 Comment "//! - see: #2129"
521..594 Comment "//! - cites: [Leroy-1994-manifest_types_modules_and_separate_compilation]"
595..598 Comment "//!"
